# .dockerignore
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
dist
**/dist
# tsc composite/incremental cache (gitignored, but git status doesn't gate the build
# context). If one of these exists from a local `pnpm build`, tsc's incremental
# compiler trusts it as authoritative and skips re-emitting files it believes are
# already built — even though `dist` itself was just excluded above and doesn't
# exist in the image, producing a near-empty dist with exit code 0 (no error).
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage
.nyc_output
apps/web/.vite
tools/seed
test
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
docs
bible
*.md
!apps/server/src/db/migrations
